OL,3,GNEWSASchool forced to close due to 38
OL,4,Awater leaks in temporary roof
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school whose roof is
OL,7,Fcurrently being replaced has been
OL,8,Fforced to close on Friday due to a
OL,9,F"huge number of water leaks in all
OL,10,Fareas of the school", the principal has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FEamonn Moore from St Oliver Plunkett
OL,14,FPrimary School, in Strathfoyle, County
OL,15,FLondonderry, said rainwater had entered
OL,16,Fevery classroom and shared area of the
OL,17,Fbuilding on Thursday.
OL,19,FMoore said to safeguard pupils, they
OL,20,Fhad to take the difficult decision to
OL,21,Fapply for an exceptional closure day.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
