OL,3,GNEWSASchool forced to close due to 38
OL,4,Awater leaks in temporary roof
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Education Authority (EA) said heavy
OL,7,Frainfall had caused leaks in the
OL,8,F"temporary coverings" in place while
OL,9,Fthe roof is being replaced, adding the
OL,10,Fexisting roof was also in "poor
OL,11,Fcondition".
